Z||000013||artherd||08-02-2001||04:33 AM||||Hi Corinne (doh, sorry, that's what happens when I short out in the head who-s-who :)<P>Bummer of a brake situation, what's broken?<P>$170 sounds high for lines, if you haven't gotten them yet, perhaps those on the list can help you out!<P>Tell us all about it, ask stupid questions (there are no stupid questions, just stupid people who chew out people who need our help! :P) bug the crap out of us untill we all come over and have a Fiero Party!!<P>We'll help you get the cost down, there's always a way! (mention casually to your dad if he thinks investing in a little "life insurance" in your brakes is a good idea or not...;)<P><BR>Hrm, there's always asking for a raise, or jobhunt time. What do you love to do? (find a way to do that, and it's the secret to happiness, but that's another thread :)<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
